 "transcript": [
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Hello, I'm here to help you get ready for your appointment. Could you tell me what has been bothering you?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "My right shoulder's been hurting."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Can you tell me how your shoulder pain first started?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "Just started on its own. No injury."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Do you have any allergies to medicines?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "No, nothing like that."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "On a scale from 0 to 10, where 0 means no pain and 10 means the worst pain you can imagine, how bad is your shoulder pain right now?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "Hard to put a number on it."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Could you tell me about any medicines you take these days, including any new or recently changed ones?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "I can't remember the names."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Can you tell me about any health problems you've had for a long time?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "I have type 2 diabetes."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Along with the pain in your right shoulder, have you noticed anything else going on?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "No weakness or numbness."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Is there anything you’ve noticed that makes your shoulder pain better or worse?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "Certain movements make it hurt."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Does your shoulder pain stay with you all the time, or does it come and go?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "Mostly when I move it."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "What worries you most about your shoulder right now?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "Not really worried, just came for my check."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "How would you describe the feeling in your shoulder when it hurts?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "Just hurts. Hard to describe it."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Besides your type 2 diabetes, is there anything else about your health history you'd like to tell me?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "I have high blood pressure too."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Has your shoulder pain changed how you sleep, if at all?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "No, haven't noticed. My daughter calls me every night though."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Is there anything else you've noticed along with your shoulder pain that you'd like to mention?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "No, nothing else."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Have you ever had any operations?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "Had a breast biopsy, back in 2004."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Thank you, that is very helpful. I have put together a short summary of what you told me. Please read it and tell me if anything should be corrected before it goes to your doctor."
  }
 ],
